# from:length: counts characters and survives very large numbers
>> s := ['ééééééééééééééé'].
Baʼii barreessi: (s kopii irraa: 0 dheerina: 20), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (s kopii irraa: 10 dheerina: 20), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (s kopii irraa: 14 dheerina: 1), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (s kopii darbi: 20), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ['-'], dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (['abcdef'] irraa: 2 dheerina: 2), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (['abc'] irraa: 1 dheerina: ['9e300'] gara-lakkoofsaatti), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (['abc'] irraa: 1 dheerina: ['-9e300'] gara-lakkoofsaatti), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (['abc'] irraa: ['9e300'] gara-lakkoofsaatti dheerina: 1), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: ['-'], dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (['abc'] irraa: ['-9e300'] gara-lakkoofsaatti dheerina: 2), dhaabi.
